:: Act3_ArrivalSchool {"position":"500,1600","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
/* =====================================================================
   ACT 3: ARRIVAL — INITIALIZATION & STATE SETUP
   ===================================================================== */

/* 1. Track Player Location for the SVG Map */
<<set $currentLocation to "security_foyer">>
<<set $activeMap to "Highschool Ground">> /* Loads the West Wing SVG */

/* 2. Setup Safehouse Variables & Testing Fallbacks */
<<if ndef $companion_reyes>>
    <<set $companion_reyes to true>>
<</if>>
<<if ndef $companions>>
    <<set $companions to []>>
<</if>>

<<if ndef $act3_phase>>
    <<set $act3_phase to 1>>
    <<set $inSafehouse to true>>
    <<set $safehouseTrust to 0>>
    <<set $weapons_confiscated to false>>
    <<set $smuggled_weapon to "none">>
    
    /* Complete arrival objective and sweep HUD */
    <<completeObjective "reach_safehaven">>
    <<purgeCompleted>>
    
    /* Create a stash to hold the player's taken gear */
    <<set $quartermaster_stash to []>>
    
    /* AUDIO: Highschool Exterior Ambiance */
    <<run setup.sound.stopAll()>>
    <<run setup.sound.play("base_ambience", "audio/bgm/rain_and_distant_chatter.mp3", true, 0.5)>>
<</if>>
<</nobr>>

/* ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   PHASE 1 — THE BARRICADES
   ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<if $act3_phase == 1>>
    <h2>TIMBERLINE REGIONAL — THE GATES</h2>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
        <<if _arrivedLate>>
            <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/exterior_morning.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
        <<else>>
            <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/exterior_night.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
        <</if>>
    </div>

    You bring the car to a halt in front of the fortified highschool gates. Overturned school buses form a rigid perimeter. 
    <br><br>
    
    <<if _arrivedLate>>
        In the gray morning light, the scale of the operation is clear. Heavily armed sentries patrol the rooftops.
    <<else>>
        Blinding halogen floodlights instantly snap onto your windshield, pinning you in the dark.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    
    <span style="color:var(--accent-red); font-weight:bold;">"KILL THE ENGINE! HANDS WHERE WE CAN SEE THEM!"</span> a voice bellows through a megaphone. 
    <br><br>

    <<if $companion_reyes>>
        /* -----------------------------------------------------
           ARRIVAL WITH REYES (Easy Entry)
           ----------------------------------------------------- */
        Before you can react, Reyes opens the passenger door and steps out into the light. She raises her police badge high.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Reyes" "image/avatars/reyes.gif" "right" "Stand down! It's Deputy Reyes! I've got survivors with me. Open the damn gate!">>
        <br>
        The tension instantly evaporates. The rifles lower. A heavy chain rattles, and the massive steel gate slowly drags open.
        <br><br>
        <<chat "Reyes" "image/avatars/reyes.gif" "right" "Drive through. Park near the foyer. I'll handle the intake.">>

        <div class="choice-menu">
            <button>
                <<link "Drive into the compound">>
                    <<set $act3_phase to 2>>
                    <<goto "Act3_ArrivalSchool">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-blue);">[REYES]</b> She vouches for you. You bypass the hostile interrogation.</span>
            </button>
        </div>

    <<else>>
        /* -----------------------------------------------------
           ARRIVAL ALONE / WITH CIVILIANS (Hostile Entry)
           ----------------------------------------------------- */
        You put the car in park and slowly raise your hands. Three guards approach the vehicle, rifles leveled directly at your chest. 
        <br><br>
        They yank your door open, dragging you out onto the wet asphalt. They pat you down roughly, checking for bites.
        <br><br>
        <<if def $companions and $companions.length > 0>>
            They pull your companions out of the car next, forcing you all into a tight line.
        <</if>>
        <br>
        "No bites," one of the guards grunts. "They're clean. Move them inside to Screening."

        <div class="choice-menu">
            <button>
                <<link "Comply and walk inside">>
                    <<set $act3_phase to 2>>
                    <<goto "Act3_ArrivalSchool">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">You don't have a choice. You are escorted into the building at gunpoint.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    <</if>>

/* ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   PHASE 2 — THE SCREENING ROOM (CONFISCATION)
   ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<elseif $act3_phase == 2>>
    <<set $currentLocation to "screening">>
    <h2>TIMBERLINE REGIONAL — SCREENING ROOM</h2>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
        <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/screening.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
    </div>

    You are brought into what used to be a generic utility classroom. Now, it's a sterile intake zone. A grizzled, exhausted man with a military buzzcut stands behind a foldable table covered in weapons. 
    <br><br>
    <<chat "Sgt. Vance" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "I'm Sergeant Vance, Quartermaster. Welcome to Timberline. If you want to stay, you follow the rules. Rule number one: No civilian carries primary firearms inside the perimeter.">>
    <br>
    He points a thick finger at your gear. 
    <br><br>
    <<chat "Sgt. Vance" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "Hand over the long guns and the heavy ordinance. You'll get a receipt. You can check them out when you go on patrol. But in here, you're unarmed.">>
    <br>
    <<if $companion_reyes>>
        Reyes gives you a subtle nod. She has to surrender her shotgun too.
    <</if>>

    <div class="choice-menu">
        <!-- ALWAYS AVAILABLE: SURRENDER GEAR -->
        <button>
            <<link "Surrender your weapons">>
                /* Move weapons from inventory to stash */
                <<for _i to $inventory.length - 1; _i >= 0; _i-->>
                    <<set _item to setup.items[$inventory[_i].id]>>
                    <<if _item.type == "weapon">>
                        <<run $quartermaster_stash.push($inventory[_i])>>
                        <<run $inventory.splice(_i, 1)>>
                    <</if>>
                <</for>>
                <<set $equip.weapon to "none">>
                <<set $weapons_confiscated to true>>
                <<set $safehouseTrust += 10>>
                <<set $act3_phase to 3>>
                <<goto "Act3_ArrivalSchool">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-green);">[+10 TRUST]</b> Comply with base rules. Your weapons are moved to the Locker Room.</span>
        </button>

        <!-- TRAIT CHECK: SMUGGLE A WEAPON -->
        <<if hasTrait("LIE DETECTOR") or hasTrait("DIPLOMAT") or $skills.stealth >= 3>>
            <<if $inventory.find(i => setup.items[i.id].type == "weapon" && setup.items[i.id].desc.includes("pistol") || setup.items[i.id].desc.includes("blade"))>>
                <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
                    <<link "Hide a sidearm in your jacket">>
                        /* Logic to keep one small weapon, stash the rest */
                        <<set _keptWeapon to false>>
                        <<for _i to $inventory.length - 1; _i >= 0; _i-->>
                            <<set _item to setup.items[$inventory[_i].id]>>
                            <<if _item.type == "weapon">>
                                <<if not _keptWeapon and (_item.desc.includes("pistol") or _item.desc.includes("blade"))>>
                                    <<set $smuggled_weapon to $inventory[_i].id>>
                                    <<set _keptWeapon to true>>
                                <<else>>
                                    <<run $quartermaster_stash.push($inventory[_i])>>
                                    <<run $inventory.splice(_i, 1)>>
                                <</if>>
                            <</if>>
                        <</for>>
                        <<set $equip.weapon to $smuggled_weapon>>
                        <<set $weapons_confiscated to true>>
                        <<set $act3_phase to 3>>
                        <<goto "Act3_ArrivalSchool">>
                    <</link>>
                    <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[DIPLOMAT / LIE DETECTOR / STEALTH 3]</b> Distract Vance just long enough to slip a pistol or knife into your boot. He takes the heavy gear.</span>
                </button>
            <</if>>
        <</if>>
    </div>


/* ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   PHASE 3 — RELEASED INTO THE HUB
   ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<elseif $act3_phase == 3>>
    <<set $currentLocation to "security_foyer">>
    <h2>TIMBERLINE REGIONAL — FOYER</h2>

    Vance tags your gear and shoves it into a heavy canvas bag. 
    <br><br>
    
    <<if $smuggled_weapon != "none">>
        You feel the cold steel of your <<print $smuggled_weapon>> pressed against your ribs. He didn't notice a thing.
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    <<if $companion_reyes>>
        <<chat "Reyes" "image/avatars/reyes.gif" "right" "I'm going upstairs to brief the Commander. Sit tight. Stay out of trouble. I'll come get you when they're ready to see you.">>
    <<else>>
        <<chat "Sgt. Vance" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "The Commander is dealing with a crisis on the 1st Floor right now. You wait down here. Canteen is down the hall. Infirmary is across the foyer. Don't make me hunt you down.">>
    <</if>>
    <br>
    The heavy metal doors click open. You step out into the sprawling, fortified highschool. You made it. You are safe. For now.
    <br><br>

    <div class="choice-menu">
        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-blue) !important;">
            <<link "Enter the Safehouse Hub">>
                <<goto "Act3_SchoolGFloor">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-blue);">[FREE ROAM]</b> Explore the highschool, talk to survivors, and trade supplies.</span>
        </button>
    </div>
<</if>>